{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BATVNTh18B6oRDo5GHfFGS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Binary search — Mira\n2\t\n3\tBinary search works by cutting the list in half each time. You start with the\n4\twhole list, look at the middle element, and compare it to the target. If the\n5\tmiddle is smaller, throw away the left half; if the middle is bigger, throw\n6\taway the right half. Keep going until you find it.\n7\t\n8\tThe midpoint is `(lo + hi) // 2`. The loop shrinks the range and stops when\n9\tthe target is found or the range is empty.\n10\t\n11\tBinary search is O(log n) because each step throws away half of what is left.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48aef3a3-889f-4d69-83ce-5e7610e229b1","uuid":"0cd75c5b-c03e-4f14-b3d9-923672b15de0","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:39:45.594Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-pattern-analysis-subagent/scratch/submissions/01-mira.md","content":"# Binary search — Mira\n\nBinary search works by cutting the list in half each time. You start with the\nwhole list, look at the middle element, and compare it to the target. If the\nmiddle is smaller, throw away the left half; if the middle is bigger, throw\naway the right half. Keep going until you find it.\n\nThe midpoint is `(lo + hi) // 2`. The loop shrinks the range and stops when\nthe target is found or the range is empty.\n\nBinary search is O(log n) because each step throws away half of what is left.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
