{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01USCLvY5hYUDBDE7bURK9SG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Binary search — Jules\n2\t\n3\tTake a sorted list. Look at the element in the middle, using\n4\t`mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If it matches the target, return it. Otherwise, pick\n5\tthe half that could still contain the target, and repeat on that half.\n6\t\n7\tWe know the target is inside the current window at every step, and the window\n8\tgets smaller, so we cannot loop forever. When the window has one element and\n9\tit is not the target, the target is not there.\n10\t\n11\tComplexity: O(log n) time.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48aef3a3-889f-4d69-83ce-5e7610e229b1","uuid":"ef99017d-6120-46be-aadb-c5315f35d200","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:39:48.278Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-pattern-analysis-subagent/scratch/submissions/02-jules.md","content":"# Binary search — Jules\n\nTake a sorted list. Look at the element in the middle, using\n`mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If it matches the target, return it. Otherwise, pick\nthe half that could still contain the target, and repeat on that half.\n\nWe know the target is inside the current window at every step, and the window\ngets smaller, so we cannot loop forever. When the window has one element and\nit is not the target, the target is not there.\n\nComplexity: O(log n) time.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
