{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SWGD1zixaqJZA68Sxg5EHK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Binary search — Priya\n2\t\n3\tYou compare the middle element to what you are looking for and go left or\n4\tright. `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If the middle matches, done. If not, cut the\n5\trange in half based on which side the target must be on.\n6\t\n7\tThe loop keeps running while there are elements left to look at. The number\n8\tof steps is log base 2 of n, roughly.\n9\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48aef3a3-889f-4d69-83ce-5e7610e229b1","uuid":"6c5a8f09-5056-44a3-86e6-1579a0554d4b","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:40:00.798Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-pattern-analysis-subagent/scratch/submissions/03-priya.md","content":"# Binary search — Priya\n\nYou compare the middle element to what you are looking for and go left or\nright. `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If the middle matches, done. If not, cut the\nrange in half based on which side the target must be on.\n\nThe loop keeps running while there are elements left to look at. The number\nof steps is log base 2 of n, roughly.\n","numLines":9,"startLine":1,"totalLines":9}}}
