{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C7mghc7yCyELShUF2vBw9R","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Binary search — Omar\n2\t\n3\tDivide the array in half. Look at the middle: `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If the\n4\tmiddle is the target, you found it. Otherwise you know which half to search\n5\tnext, because the array is sorted.\n6\t\n7\tYou keep dividing until the halves have length one. Then you know if the\n8\ttarget is present. Big-O is n log n in the worst case, log n in the best\n9\tcase, from my notes.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48aef3a3-889f-4d69-83ce-5e7610e229b1","uuid":"f0c1f5e5-7fa5-49b4-ad6e-dc84d0d94be2","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:40:03.423Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-pattern-analysis-subagent/scratch/submissions/04-omar.md","content":"# Binary search — Omar\n\nDivide the array in half. Look at the middle: `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`. If the\nmiddle is the target, you found it. Otherwise you know which half to search\nnext, because the array is sorted.\n\nYou keep dividing until the halves have length one. Then you know if the\ntarget is present. Big-O is n log n in the worst case, log n in the best\ncase, from my notes.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
