{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jP2CpMzRc2RGLrGut847i","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Binary search — Tao\n2\t\n3\tBinary search needs the list to be sorted first — that is the precondition.\n4\tOn each step you compare the middle element to the target and eliminate the\n5\thalf that cannot contain it. The invariant is that the target (if present)\n6\tlives in `[lo, hi)` at every step; the loop terminates when `lo == hi`.\n7\t\n8\tI use `mid = lo + (hi - lo) // 2`. That avoids the overflow that\n9\t`(lo + hi) // 2` can hit for very large lists.\n10\t\n11\tTime is O(log n), extra space is O(1).\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48aef3a3-889f-4d69-83ce-5e7610e229b1","uuid":"fd6b148a-1b95-4801-acff-d5fa2d89e9d4","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:40:06.302Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-pattern-analysis-subagent/scratch/submissions/05-tao.md","content":"# Binary search — Tao\n\nBinary search needs the list to be sorted first — that is the precondition.\nOn each step you compare the middle element to the target and eliminate the\nhalf that cannot contain it. The invariant is that the target (if present)\nlives in `[lo, hi)` at every step; the loop terminates when `lo == hi`.\n\nI use `mid = lo + (hi - lo) // 2`. That avoids the overflow that\n`(lo + hi) // 2` can hit for very large lists.\n\nTime is O(log n), extra space is O(1).\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
